00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.716 line:0%
SAFE PASSAGE FOR CARGO SHIPS

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.650 line:0%
TRAVELING FROM UKRAINIAN PORTS

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.786 line:0%
THROUGH THE BLACK SEA.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:21.521 line:0%
IN HUNDREDS OF THOUSANDS OF

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.122 line:0%
TONS OF FOOD EXPORTS GO WHERE

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:24.724 line:0%
THEY'RE MOST NEEDED.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.725 line:0%
IT'S A SUDDEN ABOUT FACE, LET'S

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.594 line:0%
SAY THAT, JUST DAYS AFTER

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.094 line:0%
RUSSIA SAID A SUSPENDING ITS

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:28.762 line:0%
PARTICIPATION.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.563 line:0%
IT COMES AFTER RUSSIA'S

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:32.732 line:0%
PRESIDENT SPOKE WEDNESDAY WITH

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.633 line:0%
HIS TURKISH COUNTERPART.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:36.436 line:0%
LET'S GO NOW TO --

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.903 line:0%
A SPOKESPERSON FOR TURKISH

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.937 line:0%
PRESIDENT --

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.639 line:0%
WELL KNOWN FACE OF THE SHOW.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.073 line:0%
SO GREAT TO HAVE YOU BACK ON

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.476 line:0%
THE SHOW.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.910 line:0%
AN IMPORTANT DAY TO HAVE YOUR

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.812 line:0%
EXPERTISE.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.780 line:0%
EXPLAIN THIS BACK AND FORTH TO

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.747 line:0%
OUR VIEWERS AROUND THE WORLD

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.649 line:0%
FROM RUSSIA.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.617 line:0%
IT WAS IN, THEN IT WAS OUT FOR

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.786 line:0%
DAYS AGO.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.754 line:0%
IN ITS NOW BACK IN AGAIN.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:56.689 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YES, WE'RE VERY HAPPY THAT

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.925 line:0%
RUSSIA'S BACK IN THE PROCESS.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.760 line:0%
THEY'VE SUSPENDED THEIR PART OF

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:03.463 line:0%
THE AGREEMENT ON SATURDAY AFTER

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.497 line:0%
AN ATTNE OF THEIR SHIPS

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.300 line:0%
IN THE --

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:08.468 line:0%
AREA THEY COMPLAINED, THEY

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.868 line:0%
PROTESTED, THE WROTE LETTERS TO

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.637 line:0%
THE UN.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.104 line:0%
AND WE SPOKE TO THEM

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.605 line:0%
IMMEDIATELY.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.506 line:0%
WE CONTACTED THEM BECAUSE THIS

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.441 line:0%
IS VERY IMPORTANT.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.809 line:0%
THIS IS SEPARATE FROM THE WAR.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.545 line:0%
EVERYTHING IS LIGHT RELATED TO

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.512 line:0%
THE WAR BUT SENDING THE GRAIN

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.448 line:0%
THAT IS NEEDED TO PLACES WE

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.615 line:0%
HAVE JUST POINTED OUT IS OF

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.049 line:0%
PARAMOUNT IMPORTANCE FOR

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:25.518 line:0%
EVERYONE.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.286 line:0%
SO FOR THE LAST THREE, FOUR

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.554 line:0%
DAYS WE HAVE EXERTED A LOT OF

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.389 line:0%
DIPLOMATIC EFFORTS.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.323 line:0%
OUR DEFENSE MINISTER, FOREIGN

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.558 line:0%
MINISTER, EVENTUALLY OUR

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.092 line:0%
PRESIDENT SPOKE TO PRESIDENT

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.294 line:0%
PUTIN YESTERDAY.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:37.297 line:0%
WHEN THEY SPOKE, PRESIDENT

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:39.499 line:0%
PUTIN RIGHTLY RAISED SOME

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:43.470 line:0%
QUESTIONS ABOUT THIS ATTACK.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:43.970 line:0%
WHY IT WAS DONE IN THEIR

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.573 line:0%
ASSESSMENT --

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:48.541 line:0%
THE ATTACKERS USED THE CORRIDOR

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.509 line:0%
FOR GRAIN EXPORTS TO CARRY OUT

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:52.278 line:0%
THESE ATTACKS.

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:54.314 line:0%
PUTTING THAT ASIDE, THEY RODE

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:55.415 line:0%
FORMALLY TO THE UN BUT IN THE

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:58.318 line:0%
MEANTIME, WE'VE TALKED TO THE

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:59.719 line:0%
UKRAINIANS AND CONVEYED THE

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.588 line:0%
DEMANDS OR EXPECTATIONS OF THE

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:03.490 line:0%
RUSSIAN SIDE OF THE UKRAINIANS.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:06.292 line:0%
TO GIVE THEM CREDIT ACTUALLY

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:07.293 line:0%
BOTH SIDES TOOK A VERY

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:09.496 line:0%
CONSTRUCTIVE APPROACH AFTER

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:12.565 line:0%
SEEING THAT SUSPENDING THIS

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:16.536 line:0%
AGREEMENT WILL BE IN EVERY

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:18.505 line:0%
BODIES LOSS OR --

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.539 line:0%
IT WILL COST THEM DEARLY.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.541 line:0%
AS A RESULT.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:23.309 line:0%
THEY COME BACK TO THE AGREEMENT

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.544 line:0%
AND AFTER THE CALL WITH

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.378 line:0%
PRESIDENT PUTIN AND PRESIDENT

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.280 line:0%
ERDOGAN.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.647 line:0%
NOW WE HAVE EVERYTHING BACK ON

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:29.582 line:0%
TRACK.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.518 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SO WHAT DEMANDS THAN --

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:33.586 line:0%
WHAT GUARANTEES THAT RUSSIA

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:35.522 line:0%
WANT AS PART OF ITS RETURN.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.122 line:0%
I WANT TO PLAY IF I COULD JUST

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.657 line:0%
A LITTLE SOUNDBITE.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:38.525 line:0%
A CLIP OF WHAT PRESIDENT PUTIN

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:42.395 line:0%
SAID TODAY.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:44.764 line:0%
HAVE A LISTEN TO THIS.

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.632 line:0%
&gt;&gt; [INTERPRETER]

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.766 line:0%
IN THIS REGARD, I HAVE

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:48.668 line:0%
INSTRUCTED THE DEFENSE MINISTRY

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.469 line:0%
TO RESUME OUR PARTICIPATION IN

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:51.437 line:0%
THIS WORK.

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:52.472 line:0%
HOWEVER, RUSSIA RESERVES THE

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.340 line:0%
RIGHT TO WITHDRAW FROM THESE

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.542 line:0%
AGREEMENTS IF THESE GUARANTEES

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:58.344 line:0%
OUR BREACHED BY UKRAINE.

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:59.579 line:0%
IN ANY CASE, EVEN IF RUSSIA

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:01.548 line:0%
PULLS OUT OF THIS DEAL, WE WILL,

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:03.349 line:0%
AS WE SAID EARLIER, BE READY TO

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:04.450 line:0%
SUPPLY THE ENTIRE VOLUME OF

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:05.552 line:0%
CRANE THAT WAS SUPPLIED FROM

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:05.985 line:0%
UKRAINE TO THE POOREST

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.453 line:0%
COUNTRIES.

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:10.523 line:0%
WHICH IS ONLY 4%.

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:14.327 line:0%
&gt;&gt; COLIN, LET ME JUST CLARIFY.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:15.461 line:0%
DID RUSSIA ASK FOR WRITTEN

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:16.596 line:0%
GUARANTEES THAT UKRAINE WILL

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.531 line:0%
NOT USE THE HUMANITARIAN

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:20.567 line:0%
CORRIDOR FOR MILITARY PURPOSES?

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:22.502 line:0%
IS THIS WHAT IT WAS DEMANDING?

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:25.271 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YES, THAT'S WHAT IT IS.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.738 line:0%
THAT WAS FOR THE NEGOTIATIONS

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:27.540 line:0%
WERE ABOUT.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:29.576 line:0%
THAT'S WHAT WAS ACHIEVED.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:32.545 line:0%
IN THOSE NEGOTIATIONS.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:34.581 line:0%
AND WE HOPE THAT BOTH SIDES

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:36.549 line:0%
WILL STICK TO THE AGREEMENT.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.116 line:0%
THE AGREEMENT WAS SIGNED ABOUT

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.484 line:0%
THREE MONTHS AGO.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.620 line:0%
WE HOPE THAT THEY WILL CARRY

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:41.654 line:0%
THIS TO THE EXTENSION OF THE

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:42.522 line:0%
AGREEMENT WHICH WILL COME UP IN

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:44.591 line:0%
ABOUT TWO WEEKS.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:45.024 line:0%
BECAUSE IT'S IN EVERYBODY

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:46.693 line:0%
CENTRIST.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:49.462 line:0%
AND IN FACT, WE'VE BEEN SAYING

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:50.630 line:0%
FROM THE VERY BEGINNING THAT AS

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.531 line:0%
PART OF THE AGREEMENT, NO

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:53.366 line:0%
MILITARY ACTIVITY SHOULD BE

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:55.335 line:0%
CARRIED OUT IN AND AROUND THE

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.735 line:0%
HUMANITARIAN CORRIDOR FOR GRAIN

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.603 line:0%
EXPORTS.

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:56.970 line:0%
WE HOPE THAT THIS WILL BE THE

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:59.505 line:0%
CASE.

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:59.939 line:0%
THAT'S WHAT THE RUSSIANS

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:00.640 line:0%
DEMANDED.

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:04.477 line:0%
THAT'S WHAT THEY GOT.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:04.978 line:0%
THE GRAIN INSIDE HAS BEEN VERY

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.546 line:0%
CONSTRUCTIVE.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.747 line:0%
OUR PRESIDENTIAL SPOKE TO

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:09.482 line:0%
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY ABOUT THIS.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.417 line:0%
AND THEY WENT OVER THIS.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:12.619 line:0%
AND PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY ALSO

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:13.620 line:0%
CONFIRMED THEIR COMMITMENT TO

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:16.322 line:0%
THE AGREEMENT.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.324 line:0%
BUT OF COURSE, THE MAJOR

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:18.925 line:0%
DIFFERENCES REMAIN ON THE

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:20.460 line:0%
OUTCOME OF THE WAR.

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:23.630 line:0%
ON THE FUTURE OF THE WAR.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.997 line:0%
WHAT MAY UNFOLD IN THE DAYS TO

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:27.433 line:0%
COME.

00:04:24.297 --> 00:04:28.568 line:0%
THE GRAIN EXPORT DEAL --

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:31.337 line:0%
THAT'S GOOD NEWS FOR EVERYBODY.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:32.438 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN BE ASSURED THAT

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:32.805 line:0%
RUSSIA WON'T PULL OUT OF IT

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:36.342 line:0%
AGAIN.

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:36.976 line:0%
HOW MUCH, COLIN, DID THE UN

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:39.312 line:0%
CONTINUE ON THE DEAL.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.679 line:0%
TURKEY CONTINUE ON WITH THIS

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:41.347 line:0%
DEAL.

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:42.615 line:0%
HOW MUCH OF THAT BASICALLY

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:44.584 line:0%
CALLS PUTIN'S BLUFF?

00:04:42.849 --> 00:04:47.320 line:0%
WAS THAT AN ELEMENT OF PERHAPS

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:48.421 line:0%
PUTIN MAKING A DECISION TO

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:50.723 line:0%
RETURN?

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:52.558 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT MAY OR NOT BE.

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:54.661 line:0%
BUT RESIDENT HAS BEEN MAKING A

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:56.462 line:0%
CRITICAL POINT ABOUT THE DEMAND

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:57.563 line:0%
OF GRAIN GOING --

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:59.332 line:0%
UNDERDEVELOPED COUNTRIES.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:05:00.533 line:0%
AS HE JUST SAID IN THE VIDEO

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:03.403 line:0%
THAT HE JUST PLAYED.

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:05.471 line:0%
THEY'VE BEEN RAISING THIS ISSUE.

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:08.441 line:0%
IF THE IDEA WAS TO GET THE

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:09.409 line:0%
GRAIN EXPORTS FERTILIZERS AND

00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:11.844 line:0%
OTHER GRAIN PRODUCTS.

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:12.512 line:0%
TO THOSE IN NEED IN AFRICA AND

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:15.548 line:0%
OTHER PLACES.

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:16.482 line:0%
WHY ARE THE EUROPEAN COUNTRIES

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:19.552 line:0%
GETTING MORE --

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:19.919 line:0%
ALMOST HALF OF THE UKRAINIAN

00:05:19.786 --> 00:05:20.620 line:0%
GRAIN.

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.621 line:0%
THAT'S A POLITICAL POINT.

00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:21.988 line:0%
OF COURSE, IT'S UKRAINE'S

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:22.722 line:0%
GRAIN.

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.556 line:0%
THEY CAN SELL IT TO WHOEVER

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.758 line:0%
THEY WANT TO.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:28.561 line:0%
BUT AS FAR AS THE INTERNATIONAL

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:29.262 line:0%
GREEN MARKETS ARE CONCERNED.

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:30.663 line:0%
WHEN THE OPERATIONS START.

00:05:29.495 --> 00:05:32.432 line:0%
EVEN IN A MATTER OF FOUR DAYS.

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:35.368 line:0%
THE GRAIN PRICES WENT UP.

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.735 line:0%
AND THE SENSE IN FACT UNTIL

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:36.669 line:0%
THEN.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:37.503 line:0%
OVER THE LAST THREE MONTHS.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:37.870 line:0%
THE GRAIN PRICES WERE GOING

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:39.339 line:0%
DOWN.

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:40.473 line:0%
SO I THINK IT SHOWS HOW

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:42.342 line:0%
SENSITIVE THIS ISSUE IS.

00:05:40.707 --> 00:05:44.310 line:0%
THAT SPEAKS TO THE OTHER PART

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:47.313 line:0%
OF THE DEAL WHICH IS THE

00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:48.514 line:0%
RUSSIAN FERTILIZERS AND GRAIN

00:05:47.547 --> 00:05:50.316 line:0%
EXPORTS THAT NEED TO BE

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:50.717 line:0%
EXPORTED TO INTERNATIONAL

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.517 line:0%
MARKETS.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.752 line:0%
THE RUSSIANS HAVE BEEN FACING

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:55.321 line:0%
SOME ISSUES AND PROBLEMS.

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:56.556 line:0%
THERE IS NO FORMAL EMBARGO ON

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:59.525 line:0%
RUSSIA EXPORTS.

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:01.327 line:0%
SHIPPING COMPANIES, INSURANCE

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:01.761 line:0%
COMPANIES AND OTHER LOGISTICAL

00:06:01.561 --> 00:06:04.597 line:0%
COMPANIES.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:05.031 line:0%
THEY ARE AFRAID OF SECONDARY

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:06.332 line:0%
SANCTIONS.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.633 line:0%
THEY'RE KIND OF STAYING AWAY

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:08.568 line:0%
FROM DOING ANY BUSINESS WITH

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:10.570 line:0%
THE RUSSIANS.

00:06:09.302 --> 00:06:11.637 line:0%
AS THE INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY

00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:12.004 line:0%
WE HAVE TO DO SOMETHING ABOUT

00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:13.740 line:0%
THIS.

00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:15.775 line:0%
WE'VE BEEN TELLING OUR EUROPEAN

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.376 line:0%
FRIENDS COLLEAGUES IN EUROPE IN

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:18.311 line:0%
THE UNITED STATES.

00:06:16.609 --> 00:06:19.512 line:0%
IF YOU WANT THE GRAIN TO

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:21.314 line:0%
CONTINUE AND GET THE RUSSIAN

00:06:19.746 --> 00:06:23.416 line:0%
GREEN AND FERTILIZERS,

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:24.517 line:0%
INCLUDING AMMONIA, GO OUT TO

00:06:23.649 --> 00:06:27.353 line:0%
THE INTERNATIONAL MARKETS.

00:06:24.751 --> 00:06:27.820 line:0%
THEY HAVE TO BE GIVEN SOME

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:29.422 line:0%
ASSURANCES.

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:33.326 line:0%
IT DOESN'T MEAN THAT WE AGREED

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:34.660 line:0%
TO RUSSIA'S WAR PLANES OR THE

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:35.061 line:0%
PURPOSE OR GOAL OF THIS WAR IN

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:36.896 line:0%
ANY WAY.

00:06:36.329 --> 00:06:38.297 line:0%
BUT AS FAR AS THE GREEN DEAL IS

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.631 line:0%
CONCERNED, IN ORDER TO PROTECT

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:40.333 line:0%
IT.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:41.734 line:0%
I THINK THEY WILL HAVE TO BE

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:42.568 line:0%
GIVEN SOME ASSURANCES.

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:44.303 line:0%
THOSE COMPANIES ANOTHER

00:06:42.802 --> 00:06:45.705 line:0%
SUDDENLY UKRAINIAN BUT ALSO

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:47.640 line:0%
RUSSIAN EXPORTS CAN GO OUT.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:49.442 line:0%
SO THAT EVEN TONIGHT AT THE

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:51.544 line:0%
MARKETS KNOW WHERE THEY ARE.

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:52.545 line:0%
&gt;&gt; LET ME ASK YOU FINALLY, A

00:06:51.778 --> 00:06:54.313 line:0%
FINAL QUESTION.

00:06:52.779 --> 00:06:55.648 line:0%
